#. i18n: ectx: attribute (title), widget (QWidget, tabBell)
#: accessibility.ui:21
msgid "&Bell"
msgstr "&Xhuflet"

#. i18n: ectx: property (title), widget (QGroupBox, groupBox)
#: accessibility.ui:27
msgid "Audible Bell"
msgstr "Oyåve xhuflet"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, systemBell)
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, gestures)
#: accessibility.ui:33 accessibility.ui:576
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "If this option is checked, the default system bell will be used. See the "
#| "\"System Bell\" control module for how to customize the system bell. "
#| "Normally, this is just a \"beep\"."
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, the default system bell will be used. Usually, "
"this is just a \"beep\"."
msgstr ""
"Si cisse tchuze est croejheye, li prémetou xhuflet sistinme serè eployî. "
"Veyoz l' module di contrôle «Xhuflet sistinme» po saveur comint mete li "
"xhuflet come da vosse. Normålmint, çou n' est k' on «bîp»."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, systemBell)
#: accessibility.ui:36
msgid "Use &system bell"
msgstr "Eployî li xhuflet do &sistinme"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, customBell)
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, accessxBeep)
#: accessibility.ui:43 accessibility.ui:660
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "<p>Check this option if you want to use a customized bell, playing a "
#| "sound file. If you do this, you will probably want to turn off the system "
#| "bell.</p><p> Please note that on slow machines this may cause a \"lag\" "
#| "between the event causing the bell and the sound being played.</p>"
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want to use a customized bell, playing a sound "
"file. If you do this, you will probably want to turn off the system bell."
msgstr ""
"<p>Clitchîz cisse tchuze ci si vos vloz eployî on xhuflet da vosse, dj' ô "
"bén djouwer on fitchî son. Si vos tchoezixhoz çoula, vos vôroz surmint eto "
"dismete li xhuflet do sistinme.</p><p>Notez ki so des londjinnès éndjoles i "
"pout aveur on tins inte l' evenmint ki cåze li sounaedje do xhuflet et l' "
"djouwaedje do son lu-minme.</p>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, customBell)
#: accessibility.ui:46
msgid "Us&e customized bell"
msgstr "Eployî xhuflet da &vosse"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, soundLabel)
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLineEdit, soundEdit)
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QPushButton, soundButton)
#: accessibility.ui:71 accessibility.ui:84 accessibility.ui:91
msgid ""
"If the option \"Use customized bell\" is enabled, you can choose a sound "
"file here. Click \"Browse...\" to choose a sound file using the file dialog."
msgstr ""
"Si l' tchuze «Eployî xhuflet da vosse» est metowe, vos ploz tchoezi chal on "
"fitchî d' son. Clitchîz «Foyter...» po tchoezi on fitchî son e vs siervant "
"del divize di fitchî."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, soundLabel)
#: accessibility.ui:74
msgid "Sound &to play:"
msgstr "Son a &djouwer:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QPushButton, soundButton)
#: accessibility.ui:94
msgid "Browse..."
msgstr "Foyter..."

#. i18n: ectx: property (title), widget (QGroupBox, groupBox_2)
#: accessibility.ui:106
msgid "Visible Bell"
msgstr "Veyåve xhuflet"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, visibleBell)
#: accessibility.ui:112
msgid ""
"This option will turn on the \"visible bell\", i.e. a visible notification "
"shown every time that normally just a bell would occur. This is especially "
"useful for deaf people."
msgstr ""
"Cisse tchuze metrè en alaedje li «veyåve xhuflet» ki fwait on veyåve "
"notifiaedje a tchaeke côp ki normålmint on xhuflet sonreut. C' est mo "
"ahessåve po les sourds."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, visibleBell)
#: accessibility.ui:115
msgid "&Use visible bell"
msgstr "&Eployî veyåve xhuflet"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QRadioButton, flashScreen)
#: accessibility.ui:122
msgid ""
"The screen will turn to a custom color for the amount of time specified "
"below."
msgstr ""
"Li waitroûla va påpyî, dj' ô bén k' ele divénrè po on tins metou tote d' ene "
"coleur dinêye."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, flashScreen)
#: accessibility.ui:125
msgid "F&lash screen"
msgstr "Påp&iaedje del waitroûle"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QRadioButton, invertScreen)
#: accessibility.ui:132
msgid ""
"All screen colors will be inverted for the amount of time specified below."
msgstr ""
"Totes les coleurs del waitroûle seront metowes e negatif pol tins dné chal "
"pa dzo."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, invertScreen)
#: accessibility.ui:135
msgid "I&nvert screen"
msgstr "Waitroûle e &negatif"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (KColorButton, colorButton)
#: accessibility.ui:158
msgid ""
"Click here to choose the color used for the \"flash screen\" visible bell."
msgstr ""
"Clitchîz chal po tchoezi l' coleur pol veyåve xhuflet «påpiaedje del "
"waitroûle»."

